{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0131-s001", "text": "Om en av dina familjemedlemmar, som flyttar med dig till Finland, inte är medborgare i ett nordiskt land, kan han/hon behöva uppehållstillstånd eller ett registreringsintyg över uppehållsrätt för EU-medborgare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0131-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 17.902585034013605, "peak": 0.32843017578125, "generation_seconds": 61.693029769929126, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0132-s001", "text": "Om du är medborgare i ett EU-land behöver du inget uppehållstillstånd i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0132-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.265106201171875, "generation_seconds": 22.65064779901877, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0132-s002", "text": "Om du bor i Finland över tre månader, måste du registrera din uppehållsrätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0132-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.24969482421875, "generation_seconds": 23.994983663083985, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0133-s001", "text": "Detsamma gäller medborgare i Schweiz och Liechtenstein.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0133-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.3228759765625, "generation_seconds": 20.838694262783974, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0133-s002", "text": "Du kan resa till Finland om du har ett giltigt ID-kort eller pass.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0133-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.309112548828125, "generation_seconds": 27.364992436021566, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0133-s003", "text": "Du har rätt att arbeta, driva ett företag och studera i Finland med lika villkor som finska medborgare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0133-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.338531494140625, "generation_seconds": 38.87127731507644, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0133-s004", "text": "Du måste själv trygga din försörjning i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0133-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.25665283203125, "generation_seconds": 19.295075041940436, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0134-s001", "text": "Du kan vistas i Finland högst tre månader i sträck utan att registrera din uppehållsrätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-norden-eu/narration/resume-20261103T061303788670+0000-2/hb-c12-u0134-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.263824462890625, "generation_seconds": 25.396394443931058, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
